From: pocket-debs <masterxq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 14:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] lockscreen: no input to the hidden content while the keypad is open
Description:
 With the keypad open the lock screen content (clock, media controls,
 notifications, quick action buttons) is faded out and placed below the
 keypad, and the notification list stops scrolling (scrollLock), but the
 content still took touches. With notifications behind the keypad, the swipe
 to dismiss of a notification card took over taps on the keys that moved a
 little sideways and cancelled them.
 .
 Disable the content while scrollLock is set, as the scrolling already is.
Forwarded: no
License: GPL-2.0-or-later (as the patched file)
Last-Update: 2026-11-27
---
diff --git a/shell/contents/lockscreen/LockScreen.qml b/shell/contents/lockscreen/LockScreen.qml
index a60707a25..6c07687ae 100644
--- a/shell/contents/lockscreen/LockScreen.qml
+++ b/shell/contents/lockscreen/LockScreen.qml
@@ -239,6 +239,8 @@ Item {
             onPasswordRequested: flickable.goToOpenPosition()
 
             scrollLock: flickable.openFactor > 0.2
+            // with the keypad open the hidden content must not take touches from the keys
+            enabled: !scrollLock
             z: scrollLock ? -1 : 0
 
             anchors.fill: parent
